T1  - Real-time safety diagnostics of Type III hydrogen tanks using acoustic emission testing: Precision dataset construction with representation learning and multi-modal failure classification
AU  - Kim, Da-Hyun
AU  - Kim, Gyeong-Yeong
AU  - Kim, Ho-Yeon
