T1  - Predictive models for dynamic properties of soils using machine learning approaches: A comprehensive review
AU  - Ghorbanzadeh, Samira
AU  - Jahed Armaghani, Danial
AU  - Salimi, Mahdi
AU  - Payan, Meghdad
